          "id": "scene-04-n1",
          "text": "The same model can feel weak or capable depending on its harness. The harness shapes what the model can see and do.",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9.5
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-04-n2",
          "text": "DeepSeek Harness is one such runtime: sessions, tools, plugins, skills, subagents, and approvals around the model.",
          "start": 9.5,
          "end": 19
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-04-n3",
          "text": "So when you evaluate an agent, look past the model. Ask what harness it runs in, and what that harness lets it prove.",
